 going viral, this training focuses on a much more important principle: learning to capture people's attention from the first seconds of content.\n\n## Course Content and Learning Areas\n\nThe course covers psychology of attention, helping you understand how the human mind really works and what makes content hook from the first seconds. It also teaches the viral structure - how to build pieces of content designed to generate interest, be shared, and stay in people's memory.\n\n## Official Resources\n\nThe official website (julianealborna.com) describes Inteligencia Viral as being about how to make videos that people cannot ignore. Access to the course is a one-time purchase with lifetime access.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"abfa56f7-4369-49cd-9cb3-3f2f4bb27974","uuid":"3b45f734-b655-4520-bde1-d1eb45bc2f9e","timestamp":"2026-07-29T01:22:44.942Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Julián Alborna Inteligencia Viral content resources","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01MuVViYzEJznK1v4TWM98CZ","content":[{"title":"Julian Borna | TikTok","url":"https://www.tiktok.com/discover/julian-borna"},{"title":"Inteligencia Viral Julian Alborna","url":"https://www.tiktok.com/discover/inteligencia-viral-julian-alborna"},{"title":"► Curso Inteligencia Viral de Julian Alborna 2026","url":"https://tucursoscloud.com/inteligencia-viral-de-julian-alborna/"},{"title":"Inteligencia Viral 2026 de Julian Alborna ✅【BARATO】","url":"https://miscursosbaratos.com/product/inteligencia-viral-2026-de-julian-alborna/"},{"title":"▷ Inteligencia Viral de Julian Alborna - [Descargar]","url":"https://tucursoya.com/curso/inteligencia-viral-de-julian-alborna/"},{"title":"Inteligencia Viral 2026 de Julian Alborna | Cursos Baratos","url":"https://cursosbaratos.com/curso/inteligencia-viral-2026-de-julian-alborna/"},{"title":"Inteligencia Viral de Julian Alborna 2026【BARATO】","url":"https://tucurs